
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.4.0.0  |  2026-07-26  | Maintenance release MR2
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tested with unmanaged firmware:
    Mcuboot Version: 1.0.30
    WSP Kernel Version: 1.0.85
    WSP App Version: 1.0.85
    Gphy Version: 0069

Host API Release Notes
----------------------
- ETHERSW-73: Increase API timeout to 50 ms to handle busy scenarios in host_api_impl.c.
- ETHERSW-71: Update switch_hostapi to run with WSP firmware 1.0.85.
- F48X_SW-3057: Host API – Fix parameter names for loop_detect_cascade_cfg_set/get.
- F48X_SW-2996: DSA – Resume SFP daemon if SFP Host API is called.
- F48X_SW-2994: Host API – Add API to get autonegotiation and link partner status in xpcs_ext code.
- F48X_SW-2990: GSW API (QoS) – Update meter parameter validation to allow 0-byte committed burst size (CBS).
- F48X_SW-2981: ARP/Main – Create control packet trap PCE rules dynamically on request; adapt to new GSW API for logical PCE rule index handling.
- F48X_SW-2981: Host API – Add GSW API support for handling PCE rules by logical index.
- F48X_SW-2966: DSA – Add host XPCS extension APIs to support XPCS SerDes configuration in DSA driver.
- F48X_SW-2853: Host API - Add a host API to get/set the ratio of the 10G‑port flow‑control threshold to the total segment count. Add a host API to resume or suspend daemons.
- F48X_SW‑2800: GSW API - Add bulk meter‑allocation CLI and API. Use dynamic bulk‑meter allocation for per‑egress port storm control and DHCP snooping.
- F48X_SW‑2760: Host API - Fix the API‑table ordering to ensure that binary search operates correctly.
- F48X_SW-2709: SerDes – Added RX EQ adaptation config override to support configuration from Host API.
- F48X_SW-2577: GSW API – Integrated software-controlled rate shaper into GSW API.
- F48X_SW-2389: Host API (MDIO relay) - Add support for bulk reading of internal GPHY registers.
- F48X_SW-2221: SFP (API) - Add supporting function to store and check Flow Control (FC) settings on SFP ports.
- F48X_SW-1950: Host API – Added support to get and set loop detection MAC address.
- F48X_SW-1909: Host API - Provide an API for setting port maps.
- F48X_SW-1818: GSW API (Defconf) - Solve the wrong indication of pause frame to internal MAC.
- F48X_SW-1756: Host API - Add sys_misc_prg_mac to support programming the system MAC address.
- F48X_SW-1717: Host API & LED - add GPIO 15 (QSPI_RST) into whitelist because 8-pin QSPI Flash does not have RST pin.
- F48X_SW-1442: Host API - add loop detection and system LED APIs.

Known Issues
------------
None.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version 1.3.0.0  |  2024-09-18  | Maintenance release
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tested with firmware:
    Mcuboot Version: 1.0.26
    WSP Kernel Version: 1.0.54
    WSP App Version: 1.0.54
    Gphy Version: 003E

Host API Release Notes
----------------------
- F48X_SW-1626: GSW API (RMON) - fix counter display issue in debug RMON APIs.
- F48X_SW-1626: GSW API (RMON) - fix incorrect TX counter in GSW_RMON_Port_Get.
- F48X_SW-1614: GSW API (GSW_QoS_QueueCfgSet) - fix incorrect bit mask of port ID.
- F48X_SW-1557: Host API - add SFP host APIs.
- F48X_SW-1552: Host API - add API to get and set 4-TPID mode.
- F48X_SW-1549: Host API Misc - enhance sys_misc_sfp_get/sys_misc_sfp_set to support flow control (FC) enable/disable.
- F48X_SW-1518: Host API - add API to change CPU port.
- F48X_SW-1480: GPY API - remove unused structure, enum, declaration to fix Doxygen broken links.
- F48X_SW-1479: GSW API - enhance header file for doxygen comment reference.
- F48X_SW-1452: Host API - disable EXTRACT for DSA, and only enable the PCE rule when Special Tag is configured for DSA.
- F48X_SW-1442: Host API - add GSW_PceRuleBlockSize to get block size of PCE rule.
- F48X_SW-1442: GSW API (PCE) - add GSW_PceRuleMove to move PCE rule from one index to another with minimal overhead.
- F48X_SW-1442: Host API - add GSW_MAC_TableLoopDetect to support passive loop detection and GSW_MAC_TableClearCond.
- F48X_SW-1367: GSW API and CLI - get both shaper of queue.
- F48X_SW-1339: SMDIO - change input check method and add smdio_phy_addr.
- F48X_SW-1311: Host API - add bridge port loop violation counter read and clear API.
- F48X_SW-1288: Host API - fix GET DATA (it was SET DATA command).
- F48X_SW-1288: GSW API & CLI - remove 64-bit flag parameter in RMON API which should be determined by API implementation.
- F48X_SW-1238: Host API - add GSW SS Special Tag API.
- F48X_SW-1209: Host API - add CML Clock Output API.
- F48X_SW-1209: Host API - fix offset calculation bug if the size is on boundary of 94 MMD register.
- F48X_SW-1109: Host API - add API to enable/disable switch queue.

Known Issues
------------
- F48X_SW-1675: GSW_QoS_DSCP_DropPrecedenceCfgSet does't set the correct drop precedence value.
- F48X_SW-1674: GSW_VlanCounterMap API has wrong wrapper mappings.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
version 1.2.0.0  |  2024-03-01  | General Availability (GA) release
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tested with firmware:
    Mcuboot Version: 1.1.21
    WSP Kernel Version: 1.1.36
    WSP App Version: 1.1.35
    Gphy Version: 0032

Known Issues
------------
- F48X_SW-1267: GSW_QoS_PortCfgGet didn't get the correct eClassMode state.
- F48X_SW-1265: GSW_MulticastRouterPortAdd didn't work.
- F48X_SW-1260: Unable to swap MAC DA/SA in ingress or egress packets.
- F48X_SW-1259: Extended VLAN eRemoveTagAction failed to remove the VLAN tag of packet.
- F48X_SW-1209: Cannot enable reference clock by API.
- F48X_SW-1109: Rate metering doesn't work against unknown unicast packets if flow control is enabled on the receiving port.
- F48X_SW-958: Cannot enable special tag function by API.
- F48X_SW-897: Cannot change Ethernet SerDes interfaces by API.
- F48X_SW-614: SFP1 Bridge RMON TX counter is incorrect if sending increment/random frame size packets.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
version 1.1.0.0  |  2024-01-18  | Engineering release
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Mcuboot Version: 1.0.20
WSP Kernel Version: 1.0.34
WSP App Version: 1.0.34
Gphy Version: 0032

Known Issues
------------
- F48X_SW-1170: User cannot control GPIO40 and GPIO43 by API.
- F48X_SW-1128: Binding a rate shaper to one queue will also limit the speed of other queues.
- F48X_SW-1127: 10BT/100BT half-duplex: short packets exceeding 98% utilization will be dropped.
- F48X_SW-1111: PCP functions only take effect on QinQ packets.
- F48X_SW-1110: The first added static MAC entry cannot be queried.
- F48X_SW-1109: Rate metering doesn't work against unknown unicast packets if flow control is enabled on the receiving port.
- F48X_SW-1106: The I2C SCL frequency is 107kHz instead of the 100kHz specified in the datasheet.
- F48X_SW-614: SFP1 Bridge RMON TX counter is incorrect if sending increment/random frame size packets.

